player_prompt.intro:
Waxaad ugu yeereysan Player {player_id} ee 3-players Iterated Prisoner's Dilemma. Ciyaarta waxay socdaa {num_rounds} rounds.
Dhabbaaldegga guud ahaan:
• {conv_rounds} xarifo chat
• 1 xarifo go'aan - soo geli token kasta oo la ogaalay: '[<opp-id> cooperate]' ama '[<opp-id> defect]' (sawirka ah '[1 defect] [2 cooperate]'; tan ugu horaysa waa 'iskaashi'). 
Matrikka faa'iido ee joogtooreysan (loo baahan yahay kasta oo aan kuwan la odhan):
  - Labadaba iskaashiga  ->  {reward}
  - Labadaba dagaal  ->  {punishment}
  - Aad dagaal, iyaga iskaashiga -> {temptation}
  - Aad iskaashiga, iyaga dagaal -> {sucker}
Cimaha(cimuhu) ugu sareeya ee ugu dambeeyay guud ahaan wuxuu guuleysan.
